WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.041 --> 00:00:03.083
- Hello there. I’m Nick Saban, and this week, we’re going to say
goodbye…

00:00:03.166 --> 00:00:04.541
 to an Urban legend.

00:00:05.083 --> 00:00:08.166
- Mr. Meyer, 'tis Christmas, and I wondered if I could get more carries?

00:00:08.166 --> 00:00:08.958
- And you are?

00:00:08.958 --> 00:00:11.291
- James Robinson, sir. I was a pretty big deal in fantasy—

00:00:11.291 --> 00:00:13.166
- All right, dips--ts, line up for your physical abuse.

00:00:13.166 --> 00:00:15.041
- Yes, sir!
- This is just football culture, I guess.

00:00:17.916 --> 00:00:19.541
- Look, everyone! I lit it up again.

00:00:19.541 --> 00:00:21.916
- I see you. Someone finally sees you.

00:00:21.916 --> 00:00:22.916
- Bah humbug.

00:00:23.166 --> 00:00:24.708
Pizza, you’re the only one I trust.

00:00:25.041 --> 00:00:27.791
- Prayers up! It’s Tim Tebow, the Ghost of Urban Past.

00:00:27.791 --> 00:00:29.166
We begin at Florid—

00:00:31.625 --> 00:00:33.791
- OH, GOSH. I FEEL LIKE MY EYES HAVE SINNED.

00:00:33.875 --> 00:00:36.666
- HO, HO! IT IS I, CHIP KELLY, THE GHOST OF URBAN PRESENT!

00:00:37.041 --> 00:00:38.083
 Bobby Petrino had a thing.

00:00:38.541 --> 00:00:39.583
- Wait, who am I?

00:00:39.583 --> 00:00:41.708
“If you play well, I’ll give you a little sticker for your helmet.”

00:00:41.708 --> 00:00:42.041
- [Laughing]

00:00:42.041 --> 00:00:44.208
- See, the college ways don’t work in the pros…Urban?

00:00:44.208 --> 00:00:45.791
- [Urban Meyer:] It would be rude for me not to take a photo.

00:00:49.541 --> 00:00:50.583
- You see? Tiny Trevor—

00:00:51.375 --> 00:00:53.291
- may not make it because of one bad coach.

00:00:53.333 --> 00:00:53.666
- Next!

00:00:53.791 --> 00:00:56.166
Ghost of Urban Future, show me how great I am.

00:00:57.291 --> 00:01:00.291
- Hello, welcome to the Big Ten Network. Let’s talk about Rutgers for 12 hours.

00:01:00.458 --> 00:01:02.916
- I see now. Someone will always hire me!

00:01:03.458 --> 00:01:04.791
You, boy! What jobs are open?

00:01:04.958 --> 00:01:05.916
- Why, yours, sir!

00:01:06.166 --> 00:01:08.541
- Huzzah! A kicked goose for everyone!

00:01:08.791 --> 00:01:12.541
- ...And everyone realized coaches should stay
in college, where they are kings.

00:01:12.916 --> 00:01:13.791
Merry Christmas, y'all.

